(***************************************************************************)
(* Server Message Payload, selected by Transaction Code                    *)
(***************************************************************************)

SystemInformationOutMessageCode == 1601  \* 0x641
PartialSystemInformationMessageCode == 7321  \* 0x1c99
OpenOrderReportMessageCode == 1821  \* 0x71d
SpreadOrderLogReportMessageCode == 1992  \* 0x7c8
SpreadTradeReportMessageCode == 1993  \* 0x7c9
BoardLotOutMessageCode == 2001  \* 0x7d1
NegOrderToBlMessageCode == 2008  \* 0x7d8
OrderModOutMessageCode == 2041  \* 0x7f9
OrderModRejectMessageCode == 2042  \* 0x7fa
OrderCancelOutMessageCode == 2071  \* 0x817
OrderCancelRejectMessageCode == 2072  \* 0x818
OrderConfirmationMessageCode == 2073  \* 0x819
OrderModConfirmationMessageCode == 2074  \* 0x81a
OrderCancelConfirmationMessageCode == 2075  \* 0x81b
CancelNegOrderMessageCode == 2076  \* 0x81c
FreezeToControlMessageCode == 2170  \* 0x87a
OrderErrorMessageCode == 2231  \* 0x8b7
